msgid "Reduce build and test times with module caching, selective testing, and test sharding."
msgstr "通过模块缓存、选择性测试和测试分片来减少构建和测试时间。"

#: lib/tuist_web/live/docs_live.ex:234
#: lib/tuist_web/live/docs_live.ex:691
